OL,3,GNEWSAVikings and markets to spread
OL,4,AChristmas cheer
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrimsby is preparing for a bigger
OL,7,Ffestive season this year, with a
OL,8,Fprogramme of Christmas events,
OL,9,Fentertainment and family attractions
OL,10,Fplanned across the town.
OL,12,FThe Riverhead Festive Market will run
OL,13,Ffrom Friday to Sunday, alongside the
OL,14,FGreat Grimsby Christmas Festival on
OL,15,FSaturday and Grim's Great Viking
OL,16,FChristmas on Sunday.
OL,18,FVisitors can enjoy festive shopping,
OL,19,Ffood and drink, family entertainment
OL,20,Fand Viking-themed activities throughout
OL,21,Fthe weekend.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
